   "dice": [
    "The Budget Constraint",
    "Before we talk about budgets, we have to say what it is that we are choosing.",
    "A consumer does not choose one good: they choose a combination of everything they consume.",
    "The set of all imaginable combinations is what we call the consumption set.",
    "And what keeps you from reaching any of them is not desire, it is resources: income, time, whatever happens to be limited."
   ],
   "escena": {
