    "To recap.",
    "A bundle is a point in the goods space.",
    "The budget set is the region you can afford, and the line is its boundary.",
    "The intercepts come from spending your entire income on a single good.",
    "And the slope is the relative price, which tells you how much of one good you give up for one unit of the other.",
    "Change income and the line shifts; change a price and it pivots around the intercept of the good whose price did not change."
